review:
edit: previously negative review. the developer kindly replied to the below and let me know that comfort vignette would be added next update. thanks! i will be purchasing the game again when that update comes out.

if you are thinking about buying this game, do it! it's good. my review is just a personal one/for people with weak vr stomachs:

please add comfort vignette during smooth movement. the game is good, but the teleportation isn't really all that viable for gameplay. would prefer to have the option for a vignette when moving as it helps out weak stomached people like me.
